{
  "id": "a1-03",
  "level": "A1",
  "number": 3,
  "title": "I am, you are: pronouns & \"is\"",
  "titleAf": "Voornaamwoorde",
  "icon": "🙋",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "a1-03-1",
      "title": "Pronouns",
      "explanation": [
        "| | singular | plural |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1st | **ek** (I) | **ons** (we) |\n| 2nd | **jy** / **u** (you) | **julle** (you all) |\n| 3rd | **hy** (he), **sy** (she), **dit** (it) | **hulle** (they) |",
        "Good news: \"to be\" is just **is** for everyone. **Ek is**, **jy is**, **hulle is**. No *am / are / is* to remember!"
      ],
      "examples": [
        { "af": "Ek is moeg.", "en": "I am tired." },
        { "af": "Hulle is my vriende.", "en": "They are my friends." },
        { "af": "Sy is gelukkig.", "en": "She is happy." },
        { "af": "Ons is in die kombuis.", "en": "We are in the kitchen." }
      ],
      "vocab": ["ek", "jy", "hy", "sy", "dit", "ons", "julle", "hulle", "is", "moeg", "gelukkig"],
      "exercises": [
        { "type": "fill", "af": "Hulle ___ moeg.", "en": "They are tired.", "answers": ["is"], "options": ["is", "are", "het"] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "We are happy.", "answers": ["Ons is gelukkig."] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "She is tired.", "answers": ["Sy is moeg."] },
        { "type": "choice", "question": "\"Julle\" means…", "options": ["they", "you (plural)", "we"], "answer": "you (plural)" },
        { "type": "order", "en": "They are my friends.", "af": "Hulle is my vriende." },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "af", "prompt": "Hy is in die kombuis.", "answers": ["He is in the kitchen.", "He's in the kitchen."] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-03-2",
      "title": "Describing people",
      "explanation": [
        "Use **is** + an adjective to describe someone: **Hy is lank** (He is tall).",
        "**baie** = very: **Sy is baie slim** (She is very clever)."
      ],
      "examples": [
        { "af": "My broer is lank.", "en": "My brother is tall." },
        { "af": "Die kind is baie siek.", "en": "The child is very sick." },
        { "af": "Is jy bang?", "en": "Are you scared?" }
      ],
      "vocab": ["lank", "kort", "jonk", "oud", "siek", "bang", "baie", "hartseer", "broer", "suster"],
      "exercises": [
        { "type": "translate", "from": "en", "prompt": "My sister is very sad.", "answers": ["My suster is baie hartseer."] },
        { "type": "translate", "from": "af", "prompt": "Is jy bang?", "answers": ["Are you scared?", "Are you afraid?"] },
        { "type": "order", "en": "The child is very sick.", "af": "Die kind is baie siek." },
        { "type": "fill", "af": "My broer is ___ (tall).", "en": "My brother is tall.", "answers": ["lank"], "options": ["lank", "kort", "oud"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
